Feb 9, 2026:
    Added Version.h.
    Added VEV32 preprocessor symbol & real typedef for selecting 32 bit vev's and poly coeffs.
    Added version numbers to save file headers, incompatibility checking in Save::read_header.

Feb 27, 20206:
    Added PAGESIZE preprocessor definitions in Save.cpp, used in I/O buffer alignas specifications.
    Enclosed std::locale("en_US.UTF-8") statements in Print.cpp in try/catch block.

Mar 1, 2026:
    Added Parse::eos to encapuslate proper testing for end of input string.

Mar 7, 2026:
    Fixed definition of is_coord() in Obs.h

Apr 14, 2026:
    Modified Coupling.{h,cpp} and Theory.cpp to allow products of powers of adjustable
    coupling constants as coefficients in Hamiltonian (or free energy) terms.
    Modified Makefile with commend about possible definition of MASSSCALE symbol.

May 29, 2026:
    Uploaded version 1.3.  See Version.h.  Changes include reducing spectrum
    evaluation to small second order eigensystem, and allowing use of Eigen
    instead of Armadillo for linear algebra operations (used for testing).

June 16, 2026:
    Uploaded version 1.4.  See Version.h.  Changes made to disentangle initialization
    and generator definition from minimization stage, enabling definition of both
    gauge and fermi generators at any time, and flipping back and forth between
    minimization stages without unnecessary rebuilding of observables or polys.
    Made setting of coupling value automatically switch to related minimization stage.
    Fixed critical error in addition of spec Obs to Canon::cache.

June 20, 2026:
    Minor code cleanup: merged conversion of printable characters into Symb's
    into the SymbStr(string&) constructor, eliminating to_symb(string&).
    Make ObsList internals private, but expose const_iterator.
    Moved global defs from Init.cpp into inline defs in appropriate .h files.

July 10, 2026:
    Changed SymbStr -> Str throught for consistency with master field program Delphi.
    Obs.cpp: Fixed test for attempt to catalog into frozen list.
    Nuerics.cpp: Improved error message for unbuilt geodesic equations.

